  "analysis": "The index.html is set up with all required elements. Now I need to write the TypeScript implementation in src/main.ts that:
1. Downloads /sample.pdf
2. Persists it through Capacitor Filesystem.writeFile at sample.pdf under Directory.Documents
3. Reads it back via Filesystem.readFile
